{"ts": "13:21:26.516", "kind": "mt", "live": true, "seg_id": 6, "ja": "期待と違った?へぇー何考えてたの?ふふっ", "zh": "和期待不一样？咦～你在想什么啊？呵呵。", "zh_empty": false, "zh_len": 19, "zh_refusal": null, "asr_s": 0.264, "mt_s": 0.274, "q_mt": 0, "q_late": 0, "gen_s": 0.274, "ttft_ms": 29.5, "pred_ms": 244.1, "in_chars": 20, "out_chars": 19, "max_tokens": 68}
